{"2002500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spirit Below The Waves", "steam_appid": 2002500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Below the Waves</strong> is a story-driven underwater exploration game featuring atmospheric discovery, environmental puzzles, and light combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the mysterious depths of the ocean in search of your long-lost friend. As you pilot your submarine through  unknown depths never seen before, a deeply personal story unfolds — narrated through memories, reflection, and the events that shaped the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a Journey of Emotion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonder. Fear. Happiness. Sadness and the thrill of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.poster.avif?t=1779433007\" width=518 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.webm?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/57c03db3eebb6060955786c2ddfeb896.mp4?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an intimate story about growing up, friendship, and the moments that define us. Every biome, puzzle, and encounter is woven into the narrative — building toward an ending that will challenge everything you thought you understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/b6e1d5e553f73b22132ce78e31c446a4.poster.avif?t=1779433007\" width=518 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/b6e1d5e553f73b22132ce78e31c446a4.webm?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/b6e1d5e553f73b22132ce78e31c446a4.mp4?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the thing about stories is… They always have a twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/2349db9d48020932a0438d0a6c9d5457.poster.avif?t=1779433007\" width=518 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/2349db9d48020932a0438d0a6c9d5457.webm?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002500/extras/2349db9d48020932a0438d0a6c9d5457.mp4?t=1779433007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the Demo!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Below the Waves</strong> is a story-driven underwater exploration game featuring atmospheric discovery, environmental puzzles, and light combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the mysterious depths of the ocean in search of your long-lost friend. As you pilot your submarine through  unknown depths never seen before, a deeply personal story unfolds — narrated through memories, reflection, and the events that shaped the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a Journey of Emotion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonder. Fear. Happiness. Sadness and the thrill of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_